  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev400.html",
  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.19 Principal place of abode",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.19 “Principal place of abode” means the place of abode which a person has, through all the person’s actions, demonstrated a current intent to designate as the person’s principal place of residence for the indefinite future to the exclusion of all others:\n\n(a) Notwithstanding a temporary absence if:\n\n(1) The person intends to return;\n\n(2) The person continues to maintain the place of abode during the temporary absence; and\n\n(3) The place of abode is available when the person returns; and\n\n(b) With the exception of the following:\n\n(1) Seasonal home;\n\n(2) Timeshare; or\n\n(3) Place of retreat.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16 (from Rev 401.09); renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.18)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev400.html"
